* "American Lead V", channel 2 (modes Edge / Crunch / Mark I), read from the drawing (MVPRE1/2/3.S01): V1A (the guitar's own copy of the shared input stage, on the channel 1 / 2 plate
* load R4 100k + R4A 47k), CH2 GAIN, V2A, the CH2 tone stack and its output network, V1B, the network the relays RYM1 / RYM3B leave at rest (R32 2M2 with C23 20p, R33 680k), V3A,
* and R65 220k into CH2 MASTER (1MA, wiper pot) with the mode loads R185 / R186; o2 is the channel's output (to the EQ).
* The mode selector CH2 MODE sets the SW_* as the relays read: Edge (M4) shorts R4A (*RYM4A), puts C8A 500p across R8, R20 1k5 on V2A's cathode (RYM4B) and C19 15u on V1B's,
* C11 .047 as the bass cap (RYM4C), the 750p treble cap (C8 with C9, RYM45) and the 100k slope (R212 shorted), output from B (*RYM5B) and R186; Crunch (M5) shorts R3 (RYM5A),
* C12 15u on V2A's cathode, C9A 500p across R11A, C10 .1 as the bass cap (*RYM5C), the 750p treble cap and 100k slope, output from C (R17 / R18 divider); Mark I (M6) has C12 and C9A,
* no bass cap (RYM4C picks C10 but *RYM5C leaves it open), the 250p treble cap and the 250k slope (R212 in), R15 shorted (RYM6B), output from B, R185 and R186.
* Not modelled: the J175 JFET switches (taken as closed), the reverb, the CH1 BOLD switch.

V VRAIL x 100 400
R R86 x dp 1k
C C87 dp 0 30u
I VIN gin 1
R RSRC gin in 7k
R RPU1 gin pkb1 1e12
.xfmr LPU1 L=2.5
  W pkb1 in 1 pu
.end
R RPU2 gin pkb2 1e12
.xfmr LPU2 L=5
  W pkb2 in 1 pu
.end
C CPU gin in 110p
R RPL gin in 1e12
R SWK1 in pkk1 1e12
C CCAB1 pkk1 0 200p
R SWK2 in pkk2 1e12
C CCAB2 pkk2 0 400p
R SWK4 in pkk4 1e12
C CCAB4 pkk4 0 800p


* V1A: 1M leak, 1k5 + 1k5 (R3 shorted in Crunch) and 0.47u on the cathode, 15u (J175A), plate load R4 100k + R4A 47k (R4A shorted in Edge).
R R1 in 0 1M
T V1A in p1 k1 12AX7
R R2 k1 n3 1.5k
R R3 n3 0 1.5k
R SW_R3 n3 0 1e12
C C1 k1 0 0.47u
C C2 k1 c2 15u
R SW_C2 c2 0 1
R R4 dp r4 100k
R R4A r4 p1 47k
R SW_R4A r4 p1 1

* CH2 GAIN (1MA): C7A .005 coupling, R9 1M, R8 220k with C8A 500p across it (Edge), R10 220k grid leak.
C C7A p1 n8 5n
R R9 n8 0 1M
R R8 n8 gt2 220k
C C8A n8 c8a 500p
R SW_C8A c8a gt2 1
R VRG_T gt2 g2 1
R VRG_B g2 0 1
R R10 g2 0 220k

* V2A: 100k plate, R19 1k5 with 0.22u, C12 15u (Crunch, Mark I), R20 1k5 (Edge).
T V2A g2 p2 k2 12AX7
R R11 dp p2 100k
R R19 k2 0 1.5k
C C13 k2 0 0.22u
C C12 k2 c12 15u
R SW_C12 c12 0 1e12
R R20 k2 r20 1.5k
R SW_R20 r20 0 1

* CH2 tone stack: R11A 475k (C9A 500p across it in Crunch, Mark I) to the node x2; C9 250p (and C8 500p in Edge, Crunch) to the treble pot's top, R13 10M as its DC path;
* R212 150k (shorted in Edge, Crunch) and R12 100k to the node q; the bass cap C11 .047 (Edge) or C10 .1 (Crunch) to the treble pot's bottom tb; R207 15k to the bass
* rheostat; C11A .047 to the middle rheostat.
R R11A p2 x2 475k
C C9A p2 c9a 500p
R SW_C9A c9a x2 1e12
C C9 x2 tt 250p
C C8 x2 c8t 500p
R SW_C8 c8t tt 1
R R13 x2 tt 10M
R R212 x2 qp 150k
R SW_R212 x2 qp 1
R R12 qp q 100k
C C11 q c11 0.047u
R SW_C11 c11 tb 1
C C10 q c10 0.1u
R SW_C10 c10 tb 1e12
R VRT_T tt w3 1
R VRT_B w3 tb 1
R R207 tb bt 15k
R VRBS bt mt 1
C C11A q mt 0.047u
R VRMD mt 0 1

* Output network: R14 120k to a, R15 33k (shorted in Mark I) to b with C97 120p, R17 330k to c with C96 47p, R18 470k to ground; V1B takes b (Edge, Mark I) or c (Crunch).
R R14 w3 a 120k
R R15 a b 33k
R SW_R15 a b 1e12
C C97 b 0 120p
R R17 b c 330k
C C96 c 0 47p
R R18 c 0 470k
R SW_OB b g1b 1
R SW_OC c g1b 1e12
R RG1B g1b 0 10M
* The grid of the next stage's first triode, repeated here as its input capacitance (Cgk + Cgp x the stage gain, about 80 pF): the cut does not lose its Miller load.
C CMIL g1b 0 80p
